{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Search backgrounds"},"description":"Search the AniBG library of free anime backgrounds (scenery without characters). Use it first whenever someone wants an anime background, wallpaper or scene for a visual novel, stream, video call or desktop. Words for a place or a time inside q act as filters, in English, Japanese or Chinese (\"night classroom\", \"rainy shrine\", \"\u591c\u306e\u6559\u5ba4\"). Returns up to limit scenes (default 5), each with the picture that answers the query: give the user its url, a permanent 1920x1080 JPG that may be hotlinked. When nothing fits, the result carries a Studio link for the user. Example: {\"q\": \"train station at sunset\", \"limit\": 3}","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"lang":{"description":"Language of titles, summaries, place names and texts, and of the page links (ja, zh); English where no translation exists.","enum":["en","ja","zh"],"type":"string"},"limit":{"default":5,"description":"How many results, 1 to 20.","maximum":20,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"offset":{"default":0,"description":"Skip this many results, for the next page.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"place":{"description":"Only scenes of this place.","enum":["classroom","bedroom","city-street","rooftop","cafe","train-station","shrine","beach","forest","living-room","convenience-store","countryside","school","sky","park","house","cherry-blossom"],"type":"string"},"q":{"description":"Free text: a place, a time of day, things in the picture (\"quiet cafe at night\", \"torii gate\").","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"style":{"description":"Drawing style.","enum":["cel","cinematic","painted","painterly","pixel","retro","watercolor"],"type":"string"},"tag":{"description":"Only scenes with this tag.","enum":["autumn","city","exterior","home","interior","nature","rural","school","sea","shop","sky","spring","traditional","travel","